      "excerpt": "USE OF PROCEEDS We expect to receive net proceeds of approximately $\u2003\u2003from the sale of the notes offered hereby after deducting the underwriting\ndiscounts and offering expenses. We intend to use the net proceeds from this offering to refinance existing indebtedness, including to repay commercial paper and borrowings under our revolving credit facility, and for general partnership purposes. As of September\u00a030, 2026, after giving effect to this offering and the application of the net proceeds as set forth above, we would\nhave had approximately $\u2003\u2003billion of outstanding borrowings under our revolving credit facility (including $\u2003\u2003 billion of commercial paper). Our revolving credit facility matures on April\u00a011, 2029. As of September 30,\n2026, the weighted average interest rate under our revolving credit facility was 4.36%. Affiliates of each of the underwriters are\nlenders under our revolvin",
